Usage: raphael path <path> [options]
       raphael path --id <id> [options]

Print an item’s current full path.

Paths change when an item or a parent moves or changes slug. Ids remain stable.

Options:
      --id <id>
          Address by stable id instead of path.
      --json
          Print the result as one JSON document.
  -h, --help
          Show help.

Examples:
  raphael path /work/raphael
  raphael path --id 42
  raphael path --id 42 --json

Prints:
  The full path. JSON carries `id` and `path`.

Next: raphael get --id 42

See also: raphael help addressing

